@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Business Stakeholder" as BS
actor "Requirements Engineer" as RE
actor "Software Engineer" as SE

rectangle BridgeIT {
  usecase "Submit Requirement\n(FR-01)" as UC1
  usecase "Analyse Requirement\n(FR-02)" as UC2
  usecase "View Quality Indication\n(FR-04)" as UC3
  usecase "Validate Requirement\n(FR-05)" as UC4
  usecase "Approve" as UCA
  usecase "Edit / Clarify" as UCE
  usecase "Reject" as UCR
}

BS --> UC1
RE --> UC1
BS --> UC2
RE --> UC2
BS --> UC4
RE --> UC4

UC2 ..> UC3 : includes
UC4 ..> UCA : includes
UC4 ..> UCE : includes
UC4 ..> UCR : includes

note right of UC4
FR-06 Traceability Link Management
and FR-07 Derived Artifact Creation
are future extensions and are not
part of the current implemented
use-case diagram.
end note
@enduml
